  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the lentils and soak them in water for 30 minutes.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the tandoor clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the soaked lentils, plum jam, and tempering chocolate to the pot.",
    "Stir well and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Serve the mujadara hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
